1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,820
Big friends make ten together!

2
00:00:02,360 --> 00:00:03,280
Six and four.

3
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:04,540
Seven and three.

4
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:06,020
Eight and two.

5
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:07,340
Nine and one.

6
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:08,680
Five and five!

7
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:14,020
If the ones rod can't take away enough, we ask a big friend to help through the tens rod!

8
00:00:14,480 --> 00:00:16,080
Alert, a storm is coming!

9
00:00:16,560 --> 00:00:18,540
Thirty-seven take away nine is stuck!

10
00:00:19,020 --> 00:00:20,680
There's not enough to take away nine.

11
00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:21,760
Call the friend!

12
00:00:24,840 --> 00:00:26,260
Nine's friend is one!

13
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:28,820
Add one, then take away ten!

14
00:00:28,820 --> 00:00:31,860
Thirty-seven take away nine is twenty-eight!

15
00:00:32,080 --> 00:00:32,940
Chopper's free!

16
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:35,460
Twenty-three take away four is stuck!

17
00:00:35,960 --> 00:00:36,520
Not enough.

18
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:37,940
Friend, fast!

19
00:00:40,800 --> 00:00:42,380
Four's friend is six!

20
00:00:42,960 --> 00:00:45,000
Add six, then take away ten!

21
00:00:45,460 --> 00:00:47,720
Twenty-three take away four is nineteen!

22
00:00:48,240 --> 00:00:48,960
Keep climbing!

23
00:00:49,460 --> 00:00:51,540
Thirty-six take away seven is stuck!

24
00:00:52,060 --> 00:00:53,000
Still not enough.

25
00:00:53,300 --> 00:00:54,100
One more friend!

26
00:00:57,060 --> 00:00:58,660
Seven's friend is three!

27
00:00:59,020 --> 00:01:01,220
Add three, then take away ten!

28
00:01:01,660 --> 00:01:04,280
Thirty-six take away seven is twenty-nine!

29
00:01:04,540 --> 00:01:05,700
Almost through the storm!

30
00:01:06,100 --> 00:01:07,460
Last one before we land!

31
00:01:07,800 --> 00:01:09,900
Forty-one take away two is stuck!

32
00:01:10,360 --> 00:01:11,300
Still not enough.

33
00:01:11,660 --> 00:01:12,420
Final friend!

34
00:01:15,300 --> 00:01:16,840
Two's friend is eight!

35
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:19,420
Add eight, then take away ten!

36
00:01:19,880 --> 00:01:22,280
Forty-one take away two is thirty-nine!

37
00:01:22,580 --> 00:01:24,800
We landed, everyone's safe!

38
00:01:24,800 --> 00:01:26,400
Every stuck number has a trick.

39
00:01:26,860 --> 00:01:30,760
Learn them all with Abacus Kids — free on the App Store and Google Play!
